      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Printed as a run-on list, one entry per paragraph: 'Institution, Place. Title : Name, degrees (students).' Split into fields by the transcriber; the italic title, the name with degrees, and the bracketed student figure (brackets and trailing punctuation dropped). Entries lacking a head or a student figure have \"\" in that field (nothing printed).",
        "Degrees are printed in small capitals; written here in ordinary case (M.A., B.D., D.Sc., Ph.D., S.T.D., M.Sc. etc.).",
        "Line-break hyphen removed in 'Moore-Ander-son' (Moore-Anderson).",
        "Printed irregularities kept as printed: 'F R.C.S.' (no stop after F, Hangchow Medical Training College); 'D D.' (F. J. White); 'St Joseph's' (no stop); 'S T.B.' (Carleton Lacy); 'College Francais' (no cedilla); 'Ven Archdeacon, W. S. Moule' (comma as printed); 'Socchow University' — the second letter o is printed like a c (probably a damaged 'o', i.e. Soochow).",
        "Hangchow Medical Training College student figure printed '(50 Boarders)'.",
        "Hongkong University listed 'President : Sir W. E. Brunyate' as printed.",
        "The list is alphabetical as printed except where printed otherwise (e.g. Boone before Baptist, Shanghai College before Sacred Heart, Tsinghua before Talmage); order kept as printed.",
        "No printed total.",
        "57 data rows counted on the pages (26 on p. 559, 31 on p. 560); 57 transcribed."
